"送るのは、決まった指示文、予定の件名と開始・終了時刻、予定の時間内にある発話とメモの時刻と本文だけです。1日のまとめでは、その日の予定の件名と時刻、作成済みの予定のノート、その日の発話とメモを送ります。録音した音声、カレンダー名、参加者、ほかの日の記録、音声入力の履歴、APIキーは送りません。" = "Only the fixed instructions, the event title with its start and end time, and the time and text of the utterances and memos inside the event are sent. For the daily digest, the titles and times of that day's events, the event notes already made, and that day's utterances and memos are sent. Recorded audio, calendar names, attendees, records from other days, dictation history, and API keys are never sent.";
"今日のリクエスト" = "Requests Today";
